Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:47.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\3c&H009568F9\blur8\t(250,250,\3c&H000000&)\t(334,417,\3c&H009568F9)\t(792,792,\3c&H000000&)\t(876,959,\3c&H009568F9)\t(1335,1335,\3c&H000000&)\t(1420,1502,\3c&H009568F9)\t(2586,2586,\3c&H000000&)\t(2670,2753,\3c&H009568F9)\t(3170,3170,\3c&H000000&)\t(3254,3337,\3c&H009568F9)\t(3754,3754,\3c&H000000&)\t(3838,3921,\3c&H009568F9)\t(5005,5005,\3c&H000000&)\t(5010,5172,\3c&H009568F9)\t(5589,5589,\3c&H000000&)\t(5673,5756,\3c&H009568F9)\t(6256,6256,\3c&H000000&)\t(6340,6423,\3c&H009568F9)}誰にも見せなくても　綺麗なものは綺麗
